      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Patients experiencing pain from cancer make up a large part of the caseload for most home care and hospice nurses. This article presents up-to-date information on the medications, strategies, and considerations in managing these patients. Helpful tables, reference points, and tips from a pain management expert are also presented."},
